{"sha": "b1285ec655fb2fd60b0c3e29e930c8e522527711f0c66943f1ad10bd73ff1e7d", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:dc-circuits} 章 --- 直流电路：基尔霍夫定律与定理}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:dc-circuits:1}", "$q = 1.5 \\times 3600 = \\qty{5400}{C}$，$N = 5400/1.6\\times10^{-19} =", "\\num{3.4e22}$ 个电子。$c/f$：\\qty{6000}{km}，\\qty{50}{Hz}（家用：", "是）；\\qty{300}{m}，\\qty{1}{MHz}（\\qty{10}{cm} 电路：是）；", "\\qty{30}{cm}，\\qty{1}{GHz}，与 \\qty{10}{cm} 相当：否。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:dc-circuits:2}", "$I = 2000/230 = \\qty{8.7}{A}$；$R = U^2/P = \\qty{26.5}{\\ohm}$；$E =", "\\qty{6.0}{kWh} = \\qty{2.2e7}{J}$。导线：单根导体 $R = 1.7\\times10^{-8}", "\\times 5.0/1.5\\times10^{-6} = \\qty{57}{m\\ohm}$，两根导体", "\\qty{0.11}{\\ohm}：$P = 0.11 \\times 8.7^2 = \\qty{8.6}{W}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:dc-circuits:3}", "串联 \\qty{60}{\\ohm}；并联 $1/(0.1 + 0.05 + 0.033) = \\qty{5.5}{\\ohm}$；", "$10 \\parallel 20 = \\qty{6.7}{\\ohm}$，再加 $30$：\\qty{36.7}{\\ohm}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:dc-circuits:4}", "$u_2 = 12 \\times 2.2/6.9 = \\qty{3.83}{V}$。带载：$2.2 \\parallel 2.2 =", "\\qty{1.1}{k\\ohm}$，$u_2 = 12 \\times 1.1/5.8 = \\qty{2.28}{V}$：负载", "使分压器输出下降 $40\\%$ --- 分压器只有", "接入电阻远大于自身的负载时，才能真正“分压”。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:dc-circuits:5}", "$r = (12.6 - 11.4)/120 = \\qty{10}{m\\ohm}$；$I_N = 12.6/0.010 =", "\\qty{1260}{A}$。传给起动机的功率 $11.4 \\times 120 = \\qty{1.37}{kW}$；损耗", "$0.010 \\times 120^2 = \\qty{144}{W}$；效率 $1368/1512 = 90\\%$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:dc-circuits:6}", "$E_{\\mathrm{Th}} = \\qty{3.83}{V}$（开路分压器）；$R_{\\mathrm{Th}}", "= 4.7 \\parallel 2.2 = \\qty{1.50}{k\\ohm}$（电源短路）。带载：", "$u = 3.83 \\times 2.2/(1.50 + 2.2) = \\qty{2.28}{V}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:dc-circuits:7}", "叠加：仅 $E_1$ 作用时，看到的是 $r_2 \\parallel R = \\qty{1.0}{\\ohm}$，", "$u = 10 \\times 1/(1 + 1) = \\qty{5.0}{V}$；仅 $E_2$ 作用时，看到的是 $r_1 \\parallel R", "= \\qty{0.667}{\\ohm}$，$u = 5 \\times 0.667/2.667 = \\qty{1.25}{V}$；总计", "\\qty{6.25}{V}。米尔曼公式：$(10/1 + 5/2 + 0/2)/(1 + 0.5 + 0.5) = \\qty{6.25}{V}$。", "电池 1：$(10 - 6.25)/1 = \\qty{3.75}{A}$ 输出；电池 2：$(5 - 6.25)/2", "= \\qty{-0.63}{A}$，即 \\qty{0.63}{A} \\emph{流入}电池 2 --- 它正被", "较强的电池充电；负载电流 $6.25/2 = \\qty{3.1}{A}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:dc-circuits:8}", "$i = 9/(R + 3)$，$P = Ri^2$，$\\eta = R/(R + 3)$：$\\qty{1}{\\ohm}$：", "\\qty{5.1}{W}，$25\\%$；$\\qty{3}{\\ohm}$：\\qty{6.75}{W}，$50\\%$；", "$\\qty{12}{\\ohm}$：\\qty{4.3}{W}，$80\\%$。电池供电的装置需要", "高效率（延长电池寿命），因此 $R \\gg r$；匹配负载时，有一半能量", "在电池内部以热量形式损耗。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:dc-circuits:9}", "$R = (5.0 - 2.0)/0.015 = \\qty{200}{\\ohm}$；$P_R = 3.0 \\times 0.015 =", "\\qty{45}{mW}$，$P_{\\mathrm{LED}} = 2.0 \\times 0.015 = \\qty{30}{mW}$。负载", "线从 $(0, \\qty{25}{mA})$ 到 $(\\qty{5}{V}, 0)$，与竖直的", "伏安特性相交于 \\qty{2.0}{V}。在 \\qty{3.3}{V} 时，同一电阻只给出", "\\qty{6.5}{mA}；要得到 \\qty{15}{mA}，需要 $R = 1.3/0.015 =", "\\qty{87}{\\ohm}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:dc-circuits:10}", "$u = E\\left[\\dfrac12 - \\dfrac{1 + \\epsilon}{2 + \\epsilon}\\right] =", "-E\\dfrac{\\epsilon}{2(2 + \\epsilon)} \\approx -\\dfrac{E\\epsilon}{4} =", "\\qty{-1.25}{mV}$。在简单分压器中，同样的变化叠加在", "\\qty{2.5}{V} 的偏置之上（\\qty{2.50125}{V}）；电桥则在零附近输出", "\\qty{1.25}{mV}，可以放大一千倍而", "不产生饱和。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:dc-circuits:11}", "由对称性，入口角的三个相邻节点具有同一", "电势，出口角的三个相邻节点具有另一电势。电流", "$I$ 在三条入口边中分为 $I/3$，每条再分为两股", "$I/6$，沿六条中间边流动，它们在", "三条出口边中重新汇合为 $I/3$。电压：$RI/3 + RI/6 + RI/3 = 5RI/6$，因此", "$R_{\\mathrm{eq}} = 5R/6$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:dc-circuits:12}", "戴维南等效：$E = I_N r = \\qty{8.0}{V}$，与 \\qty{4.0}{\\ohm} 串联。", "回路：$8.0 - 6.0 = (4.0 + 2.0)i$，$i = \\qty{0.33}{A}$，方向指向电池。", "电池获得 $6.0 \\times 0.33 = \\qty{2.0}{W}$（充电）；", "\\qty{2}{\\ohm} 电阻耗散 \\qty{0.22}{W}；诺顿等效对的端电压为", "$8.0 - 4.0 \\times 0.33 = \\qty{6.67}{V}$，因此其", "\\qty{4}{\\ohm} 电阻中通过 \\qty{1.67}{A}，耗散 \\qty{11.1}{W}，而", "电流源输出 $2.0 \\times 6.67 = \\qty{13.3}{W}$ --- 功率", "恰好平衡。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b1:dc-circuits:1}", "\\textbf{1.} 理想电动势 $E$ 与 $r$ 串联：$u = E - ri$。", "", "\\textbf{2.} $u(0) = \\qty{12.6}{V}$；$I_N = E/r = \\qty{1260}{A}$。若用扳手", "跨接在接线柱两端，电流将流过它：$\\qty{16}{kW}$ 的功率", "集中在几克钢材中 --- 它熔化并四处飞溅。", "", "\\textbf{3.} 电流源 $I_N = \\qty{1260}{A}$ 与", "\\qty{10}{m\\ohm} 并联。", "", "\\textbf{4.} $i = E/(R + r)$；$u = ER/(R + r)$；$P_R = E^2R/(R + r)^2$；", "$P_r = E^2r/(R + r)^2$。", "", "\\textbf{5.} $\\dd P_R/\\dd R \\propto (r - R)$：在 $R = r$ 时取最大值，", "$P_{\\max} = E^2/4r = 12.6^2/0.040 = \\qty{4.0}{kW}$；效率", "$R/(R + r) = 50\\%$。", ""]}